The mention of the brochures reminded me... if any multilingual
fellows want to help Lojban out, without having yet learned Lojban,
there are ways!

There are all sorts of English materials which ought to be translated
into other languages. There is small stuff that'll take an hour or two,
and there is big stuff.

If you're interested, let me know privately, and I'll find something for
you. If it turns out to be too much for you, no problem. You can always
unvolunteer, with no hard feelings.

If you're not multilingual, well, I don't have anything for you off
the top of my head, but you can either ask the list, or myself, and
I'm sure something can be located. (Donations to the LLG are, of
course, always welcome. :)

